  "as_of": "2026-09-10",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would impose an annual levy on higher education providers to recover the costs of the National Student Ombudsman, which handles student complaints.",
   "Regulations would set the levy amount or calculation method, with the minister required to ensure recovery would not exceed the costs of the ombudsman's functions.",
   "A companion bill would provide collection arrangements and registration conditions, while this bill would establish providers' liability and allow exemptions to be made through regulations."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "A provider registered at any time during a relevant calendar year would be liable even if its registration was cancelled.",
   "The Australian National University's existing tax exemption would not prevent the levy applying.",
   "Regulations could index the amounts used for the levy.",
   "State and territory Crown providers would be covered, subject to constitutional protection for state property."
  ],
  "affected": "Higher education providers are affected by the proposed cost recovery levy.",
